<title>USA: PACE Health Management inks new agreement.</title>
<headline>PACE Health Management inks new agreement.</headline>
<dateline>WEST DES MOINES, Iowa 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>PACE Health Management Systems Inc said Monday it signed an agreement to provide its Care Management System to eight additional rehabilitation hospitals run by Continental Medical Systems.</p>
<p>Continental Medical Systems, which operates 35 hospitals, is a division of Horizon/CMS Healthcare Corp.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>PACE Health Management Systems provides advanced patient care management software.</p>
<p>Its shares closed down 1/2 Monday at 2-7/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
